<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Minikube on Kerolt's Note</title><link>https://kerolt.github.io/tags/minikube/</link><description>Recent content in Minikube on Kerolt's Note</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kerolt.github.io/tags/minikube/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kind 与 Minikube 配置代理</title><link>https://kerolt.github.io/p/kind-%E4%B8%8E-minikube-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://kerolt.github.io/p/kind-%E4%B8%8E-minikube-%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%BB%A3%E7%90%86/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="what"&gt;What&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;本地的 kind / minikube 集群拉取镜像时，总是报同一个错误：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;spec.containers&lt;span class="o"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;nginx&lt;span class="o"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;: Failed to pull image &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;nginx:alpine&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: failed to pull and unpack image &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;docker.io/library/nginx:alpine&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: failed to resolve reference &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;docker.io/library/nginx:alpine&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: failed to &lt;span class="k"&gt;do&lt;/span&gt; request: Head &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://registry-1.docker.io/v2/library/nginx/manifests/alpine &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: proxyconnect tcp: dial tcp 127.0.0.1:7890: connect: connection refused
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;明明宿主机上已经开着代理（Clash，7890 端口），为什么容器里还是连不上？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>